---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../config";
---

<Base description="Independent consulting: AI-assisted development, AI-powered features and agents, and software architecture from an engineer with 30+ years of shipping high-stakes software.">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>{site.name}</h1>
    <p class="tagline">{site.tagline}</p>
    <p class="lede">
      I've written software for 30+ years, much of it where mistakes are expensive:
      medical device firmware, clinical decision support, and systems that hospitals and
      health plans run every day. Now I help teams put AI to work, both in how they build
      software and in what they ship, with the specs, tests, and review that make it
      trustworthy.
    </p>
    <p>I take on a small number of interesting projects at a time. If yours is one, let's talk.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button" href={site.bookingUrl} data-booking>Book a call</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/contact/">Send a message</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <h2>What I help with</h2>
  <ul class="cards">
    <li class="card">
      <h3>AI-assisted development</h3>
      <p>Get your team productive with AI coding tools without giving up quality.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="card">
      <h3>AI-powered features &amp; agents</h3>
      <p>LLM integrations, agents, and MCP servers that hold up in production.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="card">
      <h3>Architecture &amp; modernization</h3>
      <p>Design new systems, and replace aging ones without stopping the work they do.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="card">
      <h3>High-stakes &amp; regulated systems</h3>
      <p>Security, compliance, and integration where the data is sensitive.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="card">
      <h3>Fractional technology leadership</h3>
      <p>A senior technical voice for small teams and nonprofits.</p>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p><a href="/services/">More about each service →</a></p>

  <h2>Background</h2>
  <ul class="proof">
    <li>30+ years of software and firmware engineering, from assembly language to AI agents.</li>
    <li>15 years as a Staff Software Engineer at MedKeeper / Becton Dickinson, on HIPAA-regulated systems.</li>
    <li>Built a pharmaceutical dosing product, Doseresponse, that BD later acquired.</li>
    <li>
      I publish my AI development methodology as open source:
      <a href="https://github.com/vpciii/methodology">vpciii/methodology</a>.
    </li>
  </ul>
</Base>
